{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Train Company</strong> is a cozy overlay idle train game where you build, manage, and watch your trains travel endlessly across the world. Relax and enjoy the charm of trains rolling through different landscapes while you grow your trainline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast map full of unique locations. Each journey takes your trains across towns, forests, mountains, and more, letting you discover new sights as your network expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your passengers and make their trips enjoyable. Keep them happy, and watch they go in and out of your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your trains to match your style. Unlock new locomotives and cars, upgrade their performance, and decorate your trains to make them truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864200/extras/e2f8335e7b73ee99871aecf06934368f.poster.avif?t=1765236082\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864200/extras/e2f8335e7b73ee99871aecf06934368f.webm?t=1765236082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864200/extras/e2f8335e7b73ee99871aecf06934368f.mp4?t=1765236082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864200?t=1765236082","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864200?t=1765236082","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864200/d54cba2ebfe02a977435f9ce79c7b8acc494af9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765236